( Statistics over a list of readings: count, sum, mean, minimum, maximum. )
Set readings to Empty list of numbers. (Build a sample of sensor readings as prose.)
Append 7 to readings.
Append 3 to readings.
Append 42 to readings.
Append 19 to readings.
Append 5 to readings.

Set total to 0.
Set smallest to 7. (The first reading seeds both extremes.)
Set largest to 7.
Set count to 0.

For each value in readings:
    Add value to total.
    Increase count by 1.
    If value is less than smallest then:
        Set smallest to value.
    End if.
    If value is greater than largest then:
        Set largest to value.
    End if.
End for.

Say "count:".
Say count.
Say "sum:".
Say total.
Say "mean:".
Say total divided by count.
Say "min:".
Say smallest.
Say "max:".
Say largest.
